_label: 'Desired property determinacy of one step evaluation'
title: 'Desired property determinacy of one step evaluation'
journey: fref("programming-language-theory/index.td")
status: 'learning'
---

A desirable property of a ${fref("programming-language-theory/concepts/lambda-calculus.td")} where each term always evaluates to the same term in a single step.
